  "_comment": [
    "A sample of what webmention.io returns, in the exact shape src/_data/webmentions.js",
    "caches. Copy it over the cache to preview the display without setting up an account:",
    "",
    "    mkdir -p .cache && cp webmentions.sample.json .cache/webmentions.json && npm run dev",
    "",
    "Leave WEBMENTION_IO_TOKEN unset while doing this, or the real fetch will merge over it.",
    "The `wm-target` values point at posts that exist on the site; change them to preview",
    "the display somewhere else. Delete .cache/webmentions.json when you are done.",
    "",
    "The last two entries are deliberately hostile — a javascript: author URL and an HTML",
    "payload in the content — so the sanitising in webmentions.js can be seen working.",
    "Neither should produce a link or a tag in the built HTML."
  ],
